  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"613\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"612\">Clinical Utility / Interpretation</strong>:</span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"1066\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"803\">\n<p data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"690\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"626\">C-MYC</strong> is a proto-oncogene; its <strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"670\">overexpression</strong> is associated with:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"803\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"715\">\n<p data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"715\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"715\">Burkitt lymphoma</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"761\">\n<p data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"761\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"761\">Diffuse Large B-Cell Lymphoma (DLBCL)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"803\">\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"803\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">Other aggressive lymphomas and tumors</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"937\">\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"845\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"835\">Positive nuclear staining</strong> suggests:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"937\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"937\">\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"937\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"880\">MYC protein overexpression</strong>, which may correlate with underlying gene rearrangements</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1066\">\n<p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1066\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">May guide <strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"973\">treatment decisions</strong>, especially in aggressive lymphomas where <strong data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1046\">FISH for MYC rearrangement</strong> is also recommended</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1066\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">IHC is a <strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1100\">screening tool</strong> and may require <strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1162\">confirmation by FISH or molecular testing</strong> for MYC gene rearrangement.</span></li>\n</ul>",
